      ":question/problem": "Triangle $DEF$ is similar to triangle $UVW$, where $D$, $E$, and $F$ correspond to $U$, $V$, and $W$, respectively. In triangle $DEF$, the length of $DE^(\u2015)$ is $96$ and the length of $EF^(\u2015)$ is $240$. In triangle $UVW$, the length of $VW^(\u2015)$ is $50$. What is the length of $UV^(\u2015)$?"
